; AgaCheck -- the AGA screen (docs/concept-aga.md, port/amiga/zod_aga.cpp) in
; FS-UAE without an RTG card (fsuae/local/ZodEngine-autotest-aga.fs-uae:
; A1200, AGA, 68040). PAL HiRes Laced 640x512, 8 planes, the dirty blocks
; through chunky to planar. ZOD_AGA_CHECK reads every frame back from the
; planes and compares it with the compose surface: "0 pixels differ".
; (1) ZOD_AGA set, orig01, a still bot match, 30 s;
; (2) ZOD_AGA not set: no RTG, so the game must fall back to AGA itself;
;     orig04 with the view scrolling (ZOD_TOUR), 30 s.
; (3) -C dblpal (the launcher's option), one buffer (ZOD_AGA_DBUF aus), 20 s.
; Hardware scrolling is on by default since 21.11.: (1) and (3) switch it
; off (ZOD_AGA_HWSCROLL aus) to keep the whole-view path checked, (2) runs
; with the default.
; Software (-o): no GL without RTG.
; LIMIT 900
; MACHINE aga
FailAt 1000
Wait 5
Echo "=== machine ===" >DEV:Test/auto.log
CPU >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Delete >NIL: DEV:Test/zod-#?
SetEnv ZOD_AGA_CHECK on
SetEnv ZOD_AGA_HWSCROLL aus
SetEnv ZOD_AGA pal
Echo "=== AGA (ZOD_AGA), orig01, still ===" >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Run >NIL: Execute DEV:Test/RunZod ags 30 -o -m Data/Campaing/Z_original/p02_bb_orig01.map
Execute DEV:Test/WaitDone DEV:Test/zod-ags.done
Type DEV:Test/zod-ags.log >>DEV:Test/auto.log
UnSetEnv ZOD_AGA
UnSetEnv ZOD_AGA_HWSCROLL
SetEnv ZOD_TOUR on
Echo "=== no RTG, no ZOD_AGA: the fallback; orig04, tour ===" >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Run >NIL: Execute DEV:Test/RunZod agt 30 -o -m Data/Campaing/Z_original/p02_bb_orig04.map
Execute DEV:Test/WaitDone DEV:Test/zod-agt.done
Type DEV:Test/zod-agt.log >>DEV:Test/auto.log
UnSetEnv ZOD_TOUR
Echo "=== -C dblpal (a flicker-free mode: shown, or PAL HiRes Laced without its monitor driver); one buffer ===" >>DEV:Test/auto.log
SetEnv ZOD_AGA_DBUF aus
SetEnv ZOD_AGA_HWSCROLL aus
Run >NIL: Execute DEV:Test/RunZod agd 20 -o -C dblpal -m Data/Campaing/Z_original/p02_bb_orig01.map
Execute DEV:Test/WaitDone DEV:Test/zod-agd.done
Type DEV:Test/zod-agd.log >>DEV:Test/auto.log
UnSetEnv ZOD_AGA_DBUF
UnSetEnv ZOD_AGA_HWSCROLL
UnSetEnv ZOD_AGA_CHECK
Echo "=== done ===" >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Echo >DEV:Test/AutoDone done
